    "created_at": "2019-01-22T06:05:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-22T06:05:59Z",
    "body": "A big (>100MB) WebAssembly module throws \"Out of memory\" error in Safari after several subsequent page reloads. Calling the `console.takeHeapSnapshot()` function in the `unload` event handler helps because it triggers garbage collection.\r\n\r\nHaving the function standardized (or at least WebKit folks have fixed the bug) would provide a better stability for WebAssembly use on Web.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
